		<section class="ftco-section services-section">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="row d-flex">
					<div class="col-md-6 order-md-last heading-section pl-md-5 ftco-animate d-flex align-items-center">
						<div class="w-100">
							<span class="subheading">Welcome to Viet Nam </span>
							<h2 class="mb-4">It's time to start your adventure</h2>
							<p>Located in the heart of Southeast Asia, Vietnam is a country of immense natural beauty and a resilient history that spans thousands of years. From the majestic mountains in the North to the fertile plains of the Mekong Delta, its diverse geography offers breathtaking landscapes at every turn. Deeply rooted in Confucian values, Vietnamese culture is a beautiful blend of ancient traditions and modern vitality, characterized by the legendary hospitality of its people. Above all, Vietnam is a paradise for food lovers, famous worldwide for its exquisite cuisine that perfectly balances fresh ingredients, aromatic herbs, and bold flavors like Pho or Banh Mi.</p>
							
							<p><a href="#" class="btn btn-primary py-3 px-4">Search Destination</a></p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-6">
						<div class="row">
							<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 d-flex align-self-stretch ftco-animate">
								<div class="services services-1 color-1 d-block img" style="background-image: url(images/services-1.jpg);">
									<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><span class="flaticon-paragliding"></span></div>
									<div class="media-body">
										<h3 class="heading mb-3">Culture</h3>
										<p>With 54 distinct ethnic groups, Vietnam offers a rich cultural mosaic characterized by colorful traditions, unique heritage, and the legendary hospitality of its people.</p>
									</div>
								</div>      
							</div>
							<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 d-flex align-self-stretch ftco-animate">
								<div class="services services-1 color-2 d-block img" style="background-image: url(images/services-2.jpg);">
									<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><span class="flaticon-route"></span></div>
									<div class="media-body">
										<h3 class="heading mb-3">Cuisine</h3>
										<p>Vietnamese cuisine is a captivating journey of flavors, where every dish balances five fundamental tastes: spicy, sour, bitter, salty, and sweet.</p>
										<p>From the iconic Pho to the world-renowned Banh Mi, each bite tells a story of our rich heritage and the legendary hospitality of our people</p>
									</div>
								</div>    
							</div>
							<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 d-flex align-self-stretch ftco-animate">
								<div class="services services-1 color-3 d-block img" style="background-image: url(images/services-3.jpg);">
									<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><span class="flaticon-tour-guide"></span></div>
									<div class="media-body">
										<h3 class="heading mb-3">Historical Relics</h3>
										<p>Vietnam is home to numerous historical relics that stand as silent witnesses to the country's thousand-year journey of building and defending the nation.</p> 
										<p>From the ancient Imperial Citadel of Thang Long to the heroic remnants of the Cu Chi Tunnels, each site tells a story of resilience, sacrifice, and cultural brilliance. These sacred landmarks are not only architectural wonders but also the soul of the nation, where visitors can deeply connect with the glorious past and the indomitable spirit of the Vietnamese people</p>
									</div>
								</div>      
							</div>
							<div class="col-md-12 col-lg-6 d-flex align-self-stretch ftco-animate">
								<div class="services services-1 color-4 d-block img" style="background-image: url(images/services-4.jpg);">
									<div class="icon d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"><span class="flaticon-map"></span></div>
									<div class="media-body">
										<h3 class="heading mb-3">Authentic Cultural Encounters</h3>
										<p>Step into the soul of our villages through traditional folk games. Whether it’s the rhythmic grace of the Bamboo Dance (Nhảy Sạp) or the strategic fun of Mandarin Square Capturing (Ô Ăn Quan), these centuries-old activities offer a unique window into our vibrant community spirit. It’s not just a game—it’s a connection to our ancestors' joy</p>
									</div>
								</div>      
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
